'''Diamond''' is a {{Common}} [[Collections|Collection]] item in the {{Skillname|Mining}} category. It can be obtained by mining in the {{Zone|Diamond Reserve}}, {{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}}, [[Dwarven Mines]], and [[Crystal Hollows]].

== Collection ==
Collecting diamonds increases the player's '''Diamond''' Collection, which grants the player useful items and perks upon collecting a certain amount of diamonds.

{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Diamond}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Natural Generation ===
'''Diamond''' can be obtained from mining two different blocks, {{ItemDisplay|Diamond Ore}}, and [[Ores#Pure_Diamond|Pure Diamond]]. Mining Diamond Ore grants {{Skill XP|+12 Mining}}, whilst mining Pure Diamond grants {{Green|+15}}.

In {{Zone|Deep Caverns}} it can be found in two locations. It is present in the {{Zone|Diamond Reserve}} in ore form only and in the {{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}}  in both ore and pure forms.

In the [[Dwarven Mines]], Diamond Ore can be found in some small decorative patches around the island, and Pure Diamond can be found in bigger quantities in the lower parts of the {{Zone|Royal Mines}}.

In the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, Diamond Ore can be found throughout the map, and Pure Diamond can be found in {{Zone|Mines of Divan}}.

=== Minions ===
Diamonds can also be obtained through the use of a {{MinionName|Diamond Minion}}, {{MinionName|Revenant Minion}} and the {{ItemDisplay|Diamond Spreading}} minion upgrade on the {{Zone|Private Island}}.

